I come into my room.
This is my room.
There is one box in my hand.
It is the box of sweets.
I sit at my desk.
My laptop is on the desk.
I open the laptop.
I start a video call.
I wait.
Where is my family?
My family is in Mexico.
It is Sunday morning in Mumbai.
But it is Saturday evening in Mexico!
The time is different.
My parents are at home.
Who is with them?
My brother and my sister are there.
The call connects.
I am very happy.
